    {
      "id": "google-mobile-ads-beta-umbrella",
      "title": "GoogleMobileAds 13.3.0 Beta umbrella 警告",
      "groups": [
        "network",
        "admob"
      ],
      "trigger_packages": [
        "GoogleMobileAds"
      ],
      "description": "Xcode 26 会对 Google 官方 XCFramework 中未加入稳定 umbrella/modulemap 的 9 个 _Beta.h 报 incomplete umbrella；构建可成功。优先等待供应商修复，必要时仅在宿主 target 使用 -Wno-incomplete-umbrella，不修改供应商二进制。"
    },
    {
